You manipulate the spacetime continuum in such a way that you switch places with another creature with in a range of [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)].  The targeted creature will be confused (power [10%, 20%, 30%, 40%, 50% (TL1-5)]) for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

The spell's hit chance will increase with your Spellpower.
